# Line list for the PN150 (Lexington/Meudon "Paris" planetary nebula)
# benchmark: the lines of Jin, Kewley & Sutherland (2022, ApJ 927, 37)
# Table 4, one entry for each component of a published blend, plus the
# hydrogen normalization.  Blends are summed afterwards by
# results/continuous_energy/m13_restoration/compare_pn150.py.
# Labels and wavelengths follow Cloudy c25.00 data/LineList_*.dat; the
# "blnd" entries are the multiplet blends of c25.00 data/blends.ini:
#   blnd 2326 = C II] 2323.50 2324.69 2325.40 2326.93 2328.12 (air)
#   blnd 1335 = C II 1334.53 1335.66 1335.71 (vacuum)
#   blnd 1909 = C III] 1906.68 1908.73 (vacuum)
#   blnd 1549 = C IV 1548.19 1550.77 (vacuum)
#   blnd 5199 = [N I] 5197.90 5200.26 (air)
#   blnd 1750 = N III] 1746.82 ... 1753.99 (vacuum); Jin's row reads
#               "N II] 1749+", but N II has no line there: it is the
#               N III] 1750 multiplet of the original Meudon table
#   blnd 1486 = N IV] 1483.32 1486.50 (vacuum)
#   blnd 1240 = N V 1238.82 1242.805 (vacuum)
#   blnd 3727 = [O II] 3726.03 3728.81 (air)
#   blnd 1402 = O IV] 1397.23 1399.78 1401.16 1404.81 1407.38 (vacuum)
#   blnd 1218 = O V] 1213.81 1218.34 (vacuum)
#   blnd 2424 = [Ne IV] 2421.66 2424.28 (air)
#   blnd 2798 = Mg II 2795.53 2802.71 (air)
#   blnd 2335 = Si II] 2328.52 2334.41 2334.60 2344.20 2350.17 (air)
#   blnd 1888 = Si III] 1882.71 1892.03 (vacuum)
#   blnd 1397 = Si IV 1393.75 1402.77 (vacuum)
#   blnd 6720 = [S II] 6716.44 6730.82 (air)
# Blnd 5875.66A is the He I 5876 (3 3D - 2 3P) multiplet total.
#
# --- hydrogen normalization ---
H  1     4861.32A air
Ca B     4861.32A air
# --- helium ---
Blnd     5875.66A air
He 2     4685.68A air
Ca B     4685.68A air
# --- carbon ---
blnd     2326     air
blnd     1335     vacuum
blnd     1909     vacuum
blnd     1549     vacuum
# --- nitrogen ---
blnd     5199     air
n  2     6583.45  air
n  2     6548.05  air
n  2     5754.59A air
blnd     1750     vacuum
n  3     57.3238m air
blnd     1486     vacuum
blnd     1240     vacuum
# --- oxygen ---
